// Every tunable setting, with its default, in one place.
//
// To change something, do NOT edit this file: put just the settings you want to change in
// ~/.config/slime-saver/config.json (see docs/configuration.md), for example
//
//   { "look": { "cookies": { "theme": "phosphor" } }, "physics": { "hunting": { "accel": 18 } } }
//
// Distances in `physics` are in "units": 1 unit is the height of one terminal row (columns are
// converted using the shape of a character cell, so circles stay round). Masses are in "base
// masses": 1 is a base hunter, whose area is its mass. Times are in seconds. Pairs like [7, 10]
// mean "a random value between 7 and 10".

